            "source_rule_id": "rule-460633535e62fabbd09b552246be723a3c6834d4c684d42e87597492b2b6ab1f",
            "start_line": 163,
            "text": "  rule closestScan(CS, I, R, false)\n    => closestScan(CS, I -Int 1, R, false)\n    requires I >Int 0\n     andBool vowelPred(intSeqAt(CS, I))\n     andBool vowelPred(intSeqAt(CS, I -Int 1))\n    [simplification]"
        },
        {
            "attributes": [
