            "normalized_sha256": "b246dcd7d7a81de803c8f1e6ffff14aa138826f5bc035c9b59b2b595f75d9202",
            "rationale": "This equation defines the fresh final summary closestVowel by initializing closestScan at length minus two with an empty result and found=false.",
            "source_rule_id": "rule-b246dcd7d7a81de803c8f1e6ffff14aa138826f5bc035c9b59b2b595f75d9202",
            "start_line": 177,
            "text": "  rule closestVowel(CS)\n    => closestScan(CS, isLen(CS) -Int 2, .IntSeq, false)"
