+## Stage 5 Lean proof
+
+I created `/tmp/audit-work/lean-proof-audit-2`, copied the generated project into it exactly as `Base`, copied only the candidate source/configuration files into the parent, and ran both `lake clean` and `lake build`. Both exited 0; the latter rebuilt `Base` and `Proof` from source. The trusted `tools.klean_final_gate.check_proof_candidate` independently repeated its own clean copy/build/axiom audit and returned `PASS`.
