+| Lean binding | Independent operational comparison |
+|---|---|
+| `_andBool_` | Boolean conjunction, matching hooked K `BOOL.and`. |
+| `«_>=Int_»`, `«_<Int_»`, `«_<=Int_»` | `decide` over the corresponding mathematical integer comparisons. |
